## Notes

- The only thing loaded from outside the folder is the Inter typeface from
  Google Fonts. If that is ever blocked, the page falls back to the system sans
  and everything else still works. All icons are embedded directly in the file.
- The page reads the visitor's light or dark mode setting and adapts. Anyone who
  has reduced motion enabled in their system settings sees the finished page
  with no animation at all.
- Nothing is tracked and no data is collected. There are no cookies, no
  analytics and no third-party scripts.
